<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main>
  <div class="container">
    <article class="prose section">
      <h1>About <%= siteName %></h1>
      <p><%= siteName %> is a free, hand-curated directory of the best online tools on the web. Instead of bookmarking dozens of random sites, you get one clean, fast, searchable hub for PDFs, images, converters, text, calculators, developer utilities, SEO, security and more.</p>

      <h2>Why we built it</h2>
      <p>Great free tools are scattered everywhere and hard to remember. We test and organise them into clear categories so you can find exactly what you need in seconds, and get on with the actual task.</p>

      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>Every listing links out to the real tool. We track which tools are most useful so the best ones rise to the top, and we add new tools regularly. Some are suggested by people like you, some are surfaced by our discovery system and reviewed before they go live.</p>

      <h2>Is it really free?</h2>
      <p>Yes. <%= siteName %> is free to use and supported by unobtrusive advertising. The tools we link to are free to use too, though some offer optional paid upgrades on their own sites.</p>

      <h2 id="contact">Contact and suggestions</h2>
      <p>Found a broken link, or know a brilliant tool we are missing? We would love to hear from you.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/submit">Suggest a tool</a></p>
      <p class="faint">You can also reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@onekitapp.com">hello@onekitapp.com</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
